<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Singapore stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore shares will not trade on Wednesday as the market is closed for a national holiday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>The Straits Times Industrial Index closed at 2,053.99, up 3.05 points on Tuesday.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
